{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bathing-the-bears-play-mat-2511-0271","content_id":"088bbc94-bf4d-4319-8beb-1b6ac3ce973c","description":"Product Safety Report for Bathing the Bears Play Mat presenting a serious risk of choking.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"7e65b5a9-3998-415a-bf36-bd9a041e8ff1","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-01-05T12:11:52+00:00","id":"7e65b5a9-3998-415a-bf36-bd9a041e8ff1","title":"Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-01-05T12:11:52+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/695baa8897f1c5e3c92a83fa/2511-0271-product-safety-report-play-mat.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Bathing the Bears Play Mat</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of choking as the plastic clips and foam arch are of a shape that can present choking and impaction risks.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Baby/Infant Stimulation Toys</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Identifiers</td>\n      <td>SKU SGS11-CET034_2, RVSGS11-250909-0003-36</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Children’s play mat with multiple buttons and other stimulation accessories.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_7e65b5a9-3998-415a-bf36-bd9a041e8ff1\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/695baa8897f1c5e3c92a83fa/2511-0271-product-safety-report-play-mat.pdf\">Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of choking as the plastic clips and foam arch are of a shape that can present choking and impaction risks. Improvements are also required to the product labelling, marking and documentation.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0271</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-04T11:50:18Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product","import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-04","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-04T11:50:18+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bathing-the-bears-play-mat-2511-0271","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bathing-the-bears-play-mat-2511-0271","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bathing-the-bears-play-mat-2511-0271","content_id":"088bbc94-bf4d-4319-8beb-1b6ac3ce973c","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-12-04T